<title>UK: UK's Nationwide ups mortgage rate to 8.10%.</title>
<headline>UK's Nationwide ups mortgage rate to 8.10%.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nationwide Building Society said on Friday said it had increased its key variable mortgage rate to 8.10 percent following last week's 25 basis point rate rise.  </p>
<p>The rise is effective from September 1 for both new and existing customers.</p>
<p>Its variable rate was previously 7.85 percent.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
